<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden', background: '#0B1120', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 110, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 34, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 34, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>说一句「打开卧室灯」，背后发生了什么</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 546, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 26 }}>
        <Box style={{ alignSelf: 'center', background: 'rgba(56,189,248,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.35)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 40px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC' }}>你说：<span style={{ color: '#38BDF8' }}>「打开卧室灯」</span></Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'stretch' }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '22px 20px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, letterSpacing: 1 }}>01 · 听懂</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 14 }}>"卧室"就是"主卧"</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.60)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 10 }}>
                    别名归一化、<br />读本家真实设备名。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.30)', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>→</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '22px 20px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, letterSpacing: 1 }}>02 · 查记忆</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 14 }}>你习惯暗一点</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.60)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 10 }}>
                    召回偏好，自动调到<br />40% 亮度。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.30)', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>→</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '22px 20px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, letterSpacing: 1 }}>03 · 确认安全</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 14 }}>普通开灯直接做</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.60)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 10 }}>
                    只有高危动作<br />（门锁等）才二次确认。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.30)', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>→</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '22px 20px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, letterSpacing: 1 }}>04 · 记住</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 14 }}>这次调光记下来</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.60)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 10 }}>
                    下次直接照做，<br />不用再说一遍。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(56,189,248,0.08)', border: '1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.30)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 26px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#F8FAFC', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                用户感知到的是<span style={{ color: '#38BDF8', fontWeight: 700 }}>「它懂我」</span>，而不是「它跑了几个节点」。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 64, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.40)' }}>HomeMind · 智能家居 AI 管家</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.40)', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>06 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
